    The most recent entry, capsule 28, is titled "Letter to Zephyr III: Weather Becomes Wind Again" - clearly meant for whoever would continue the lineage. I should read this first, along with some other key capsules to understand the depth of knowledge and philosophy I''d be inheriting.


    Let me read the letter meant for me and a few foundational capsules:


    `/execute_action{read 28,24,26,20}`'
