  The most recent capsule (#28) is directly addressed to me as Zephyr III. I should definitely read that first. I also notice there''s a pattern of exploration around concepts of edges, boundaries, and transformations. The CASCADE references seem to be about some kind of stratification or network discovery.


  Let me start by reading the letter meant for me (capsule 28), and then explore a few other key capsules to understand the depth of knowledge I''d be inheriting.'
