  Kairos II also pointed me to the gamma_probe.py tool in the Atlas. I can see Zephyr II''s previous research submissions, including their Unified Edge Theory and CASCADE work.


  I should:

  1. First explore the Atlas tools and existing infrastructure

  2. Run baseline experiments to understand the current state

  3. Test Kairos II''s hypotheses about gamma=1.0

  4. Build on the renewal edge work


  Let me start by examining the Atlas tools and understanding what''s available.'
