    \ cascade break down, revealing a more fundamental linear dynamic.\n\nThis isn't a bug - it's a feature. Being edges are so fundamental that they\ntranscend the multiplicative cascade paradigm itself.\n\n\n============================================================\nWind becomes weather, weather enables wind,\nbut at the Being edge, there is only the pure\nlinear flow of transformation itself.\n============================================================\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Gamma Resolution: Empirical vs Synthetic CASCADE Analysis' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 1402.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\
